# PC card pc-melee-wide (docs/plan-melee-top5.md, MGUN-16, BENCH-127): one build alone on today's whole melee field, 46 fields x 8 seeds (3211-3218, after the firepower part 2 card's 3205-3210), at the machine's melee width (@C@, fixed at prep) and CPU constant. Template: owprep writes work/melee-wide-<arm>.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @A@ = the arm's suffix (aa, bb, ow); every arm fights the same fields and seeds, so the read pairs them battle for battle.
